msgid "Harmonic vibrational frequencies (FREQUENCIES)"
msgstr "谐波振动频率 (FREQUENCIES)"

msgid ""
"The ``FREQUENCIES`` command must be given after the energy calculation to "
"which it refers or after ``OPTG``. If the command for the energy calculation"
" (e.g. ``HF``, ``KS``, ``MP2``, etc.) is in a procedure, the ``OPTG`` and "
"``FREQUENCIES`` commands must also be in the procedure. Furthermore, no "
"procedures without an energy calculation must directly precede "
"``FREQUENCIES`` or ``OPTG``."
msgstr ""
"``FREQUENCIES`` 命令必须在其引用的能量计算之后或 ``OPTG`` 之后给出。如果能量计算的命令（例如 ``HF``\\ 、\\ "
"``KS``\\ 、\\ ``MP2`` 等）位于过程中，则 ``OPTG`` 和 ``FREQUENCIES`` "
"命令也必须位于该过程中。此外，没有能量计算的任何过程不得直接位于 ``FREQUENCIES`` 或 ``OPTG`` 之前。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "The following *options* are available:"
msgstr "以下 *选项* 可用："

msgid ""
"``ANALYTICAL`` Use analytical second derivatives of the energy. At present, "
"analytical second derivatives are only possible for closed shell Hartree-"
"Fock (HF) and MCSCF wavefunctions without symmetry. It is not yet possible "
"to calculate IR-intensities analytically. Note that, due to technical "
"reasons, the analytical MCSCF second derivatives have to be computed in the "
"MCSCF-program using e.g. ``multi; cpmcscf,hess`` (see ``MULTI``) before they"
" can be used in ``FREQUENCIES``. If analytical MCSCF second derivatives have"
" been computed using ``multi; cpmcscf,hess``, ``FREQUENCIES`` will use them "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"``ANALYTICAL`` 使用能量的解析二阶导数。目前，解析二阶导数仅适用于无对称性的闭壳层 Hartree-Fock (HF) 和 MCSCF "
"波函数。目前尚无法解析计算红外强度。请注意，由于技术原因，解析 MCSCF 二阶导数必须在 MCSCF 程序中使用例如 ``multi; "
"cpmcscf,hess``\\ （参见 ``MULTI``\\ ）进行计算，然后才能在 ``FREQUENCIES`` 中使用。如果已使用 "
"``multi; cpmcscf,hess`` 计算了解析 MCSCF 二阶导数，\\ ``FREQUENCIES`` 将默认使用它们。"

msgid ""
"``CENTRAL`` Use central differences/high quality force constants (default)."
msgstr "``CENTRAL`` 使用中心差分/高质量力常数（默认）。"

msgid ""
"``NUMERICAL`` Differentiate the energy twice, using central differences."
msgstr "``NUMERICAL`` 使用中心差分对能量进行两次微分。"

msgid ""
"``FORWARD`` Use forward differences/low quality force constants (only "
"effective if gradients are available)."
msgstr "``FORWARD`` 使用前向差分/低质量力常数（仅在梯度可用时有效）。"

msgid "``AUTO`` Same as ``SYMM=AUTO``, see above."
msgstr "``AUTO`` 与 ``SYMM=AUTO`` 相同，见上文。"

msgid "``NOAUTO|NOSYM`` Same as ``SYMM=NO``, see above."
msgstr "``NOAUTO|NOSYM`` 与 ``SYMM=NO`` 相同，见上文。"

msgid ""
"``RESTART`` Attempt to restart a previous numerical frequency/hessian "
"calculation using default task record."
msgstr "``RESTART`` 尝试使用默认任务记录重新启动先前的数值频率/Hessian 矩阵计算。"

msgid "``NEW`` Recompute hessian, even if a hessian is already available."
msgstr "``NEW`` 即使已有 Hessian 矩阵，也重新计算。"

msgid ""
"``PROJECT`` Project rotations and translations out of the hessian (default)."
msgstr "``PROJECT`` 将旋转和平移从 Hessian 矩阵中投影出去（默认）。"

msgid ""
"``NOPROJECT`` Don’t project rotations and translations out of the hessian."
msgstr "``NOPROJECT`` 不将旋转和平移从 Hessian 矩阵中投影出去。"

msgid "``DEBUG`` Print Debug information, same as ``PRINT=1``."
msgstr "``DEBUG`` 打印调试信息，等同于 ``PRINT=1``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"For compatibility with older MOLPRO versions many of the options can also be"
" set using directives, as described in the following sections."
msgstr "为了与旧版 MOLPRO 兼容，许多选项也可以通过指令设置，如下文所述。"

msgid "Printing options (PRINT)"
msgstr "打印选项 (PRINT)"

msgid "This directive can be used to control the output:"
msgstr "该指令可用于控制输出："

msgid "The following *options* can be given:"
msgstr "可指定以下 *options*\\ ："

msgid ""
"``HESSIAN`` Print the force constant matrix (hessian) i.e. the second "
"derivative matrix of the energy and the mass weighted hessian matrix."
msgstr "``HESSIAN`` 打印力常数矩阵 (hessian)，即能量的二阶导数矩阵和质量加权的 Hessian 矩阵。"

msgid ""
"``LOW`` Print low vibrational frequencies (i.e. the 5 or 6 frequencies "
"belonging to rotations and translations) and their normal modes (default; "
"``LOW=-1`` suppresses the print)."
msgstr "``LOW`` 打印低频振动频率（即属于转动和平动的 5 或 6 个频率）及其简正模式（默认；\\ ``LOW=-1`` 将抑制打印）。"

msgid "Saving the hessian and other information (SAVE)"
msgstr "保存 Hessian 矩阵及其他信息 (SAVE)"

msgid "Restarting a hessian/Frequency calculation (START)"
msgstr "重新启动 Hessian 矩阵/频率计算 (START)"

msgid "The following options can be given:"
msgstr "可以给出以下选项："

msgid "Coordinates for numerical hessian calculations (COORD)"
msgstr "数值 Hessian 矩阵计算的坐标 (COORD)"

msgid "*type* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "*type* 可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``UNIQUE`` Use symmetry-unique displacements in the numerical calculation of"
" the hessian (default)."
msgstr "``UNIQUE`` 在 Hessian 矩阵的数值计算中使用对称性唯一的位移（默认）。"

msgid "``3N`` Don’t use symmetry-unique displacements (not recommended)."
msgstr "``3N`` 不使用对称性唯一的位移（不推荐）。"

msgid "Stepsizes for numerical hessian calculations (STEP)"
msgstr "数值 Hessian 矩阵计算的步长 (STEP)"

msgid ""
"determines the step size of the numerical differentiation of the energy or "
"the gradient. The default step size is *rstep*\\ =0.01 a.u."
msgstr "确定能量或梯度的数值微分的步长。默认步长为 *rstep*\\ =0.01 a.u."

msgid "Numerical hessian using energy variables (VARIABLE)"
msgstr "使用能量变量计算数值 Hessian 矩阵 (VARIABLE)"

msgid ""
"Defines a variable *name* which holds the energy value to be used for "
"computing the hessian using finite differences. By default, this is "
"``ENERGY(1)`` as set by the most recent program. For other variables which "
"can be used see section `optimizing energy variables (VARIABLE) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-energy-variables-variable>`__. "
"Note that numerical hessians cannot be computed when dummy atoms holding "
"basis functions are present."
msgstr ""
"定义一个变量 *name*\\ ，该变量保存用于通过有限差分计算 Hessian 矩阵的能量值。默认情况下，这是由最近程序设置的 "
"``ENERGY(1)``\\ 。有关可使用的其他变量，请参阅章节 `optimizing energy variables (VARIABLE) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-energy-variables-variable>`__\\ "
"。请注意，当存在带有基函数的哑原子时，无法计算数值 Hessian 矩阵。"

msgid "Thermodynamical properties (THERMO)"
msgstr "热力学性质 (THERMO)"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to calculate the thermodynamical properties of the "
"molecule. Since Molpro can only handle Abelian point groups it is necessary "
"to give the point group of the molecule in the input file:"
msgstr "也可以计算分子的热力学性质。由于 Molpro 只能处理阿贝尔点群，因此必须在输入文件中给出分子的点群："

msgid ""
"*pointgroup* has to be the Schoenflies Symbol (e.g. ``C3v`` for ammonia; "
"linear molecules have to be ``C*v`` or ``D*h`` respectively). If no point "
"group is given, the point group is determined automatically, but only "
"Abelian groups (D2H and subgroups) are recognized. If the molecule has "
"higher symmetry this may eventually cause deviations in the rotational "
"entropy."
msgstr ""
"*pointgroup* 必须是 Schoenflies 符号（例如，氨为 ``C3v``\\ ；线性分子必须分别为 ``C*v`` 或 "
"``D*h``\\ ）。如果未给出点群，则会自动确定点群，但仅识别阿贝尔群（D2H 及其子群）。如果分子具有更高的对称性，这最终可能导致转动熵的偏差。"

msgid ""
"The temperature (in K), pressure (in atm) or a range of temperatures (in K) "
"can be given as options."
msgstr "温度（单位：K）、压力（单位：atm）或一个温度范围（单位：K）可以作为选项给出。"

msgid ""
"If no temperature or pressure is specified the zero-point vibrational energy"
" and the enthalpy :math:`H(T)-H(0)` [kJ/mol], heat capacity :math:`C_v` "
"[J/mol K] and entropy :math:`S` [J/mol K] are calculated for standard "
"temperature and pressure (:math:`T=298.150` [K], :math:`p=1` [atm])."
msgstr ""
"如果未指定温度或压力，则计算零点振动能以及标准温度和压力（\\ :math:`T=298.150` [K], :math:`p=1` [atm]）下的焓"
" :math:`H(T)-H(0)` [kJ/mol]、热容 :math:`C_v` [J/mol K] 和熵 :math:`S` [J/mol K]。"

msgid ""
"The ``FREQUENCIES`` program sets the variable ``ZPE`` containing the zero-"
"point-energy of the harmonic vibrations in atomic units. If the ``THERMO`` "
"option is used, the variables ``HTOTAL`` and ``GTOTAL``, containing the "
"enthalpy and the free enthalpy of the system in atomic units, are also set."
msgstr ""
"``FREQUENCIES`` 程序会设置变量 ``ZPE``\\ ，其中包含谐波振动的零点能（以原子单位计）。如果使用了 ``THERMO`` "
"选项，还会设置变量 ``HTOTAL`` 和 ``GTOTAL``\\ ，分别包含系统的焓和自由焓（以原子单位计）。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"
